# `cargo cicd target prune`

Removes stale build artefacts from the Cargo target directory according to configurable age/size policy. Emits a TargetPruneEvent recording bytes freed.

**Noun:** `target` &nbsp;&nbsp; **Verb:** `prune`

<!-- END ggen:command-reference -->

<!-- BEGIN custom:examples -->
## Examples

```sh
cargo cicd target prune
```
<!-- END custom:examples -->
